    "result": "## Bug Fix Summary\n\n**Root Cause:** The parent `frai` CLI was defining a `--ci` option at the program level, which intercepted the `--ci` flag before it could be passed through to the `gate` subcommand. This prevented `frai gate init --ci` from receiving the flag.\n\n**Solution:** Removed the `--ci` option from the parent program's global options. The `--ci` flag is already defined on the specific subcommands that need it (`generate` and `scan`), so it wasn't needed at the parent level.\n\n**Changes Made:**\n- Removed `--ci` from line 605 in `packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts`\n- Removed `ci: options.ci` from line 616 and hardcoded `ci: false` instead, since the parent action no longer receives a `--ci` option\n\n**Verification:**\n- Rebuilt with `pnpm --filter frai build` \u2713\n- Tested `frai gate init --ci` in a clean directory \u2713\n- Both `FRAI-SPEC.md` and `.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml` are now created successfully \u2713",
